        {
          "text": "Pa lisiku lyatatu apelece ŵanace ŵa ng'ombe 11, ngondolo siŵili, ni ŵanace ŵangondolo ŵa mikambako ŵakwana caka cimo 14, wosopewo aŵe ŵangali yilema. ",
