        },
        {
          "text": "Pa lisiku lya mcece mpelece ŵanace ŵa ng'ombe sya mikambako likumi, ngondolo siŵili sya mikambako, ni ŵanace ŵangondolo ŵa mikambako ŵakwana caka cimo 14, wosopewo aŵe ŵangali maŵasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
