        },
        {
          "text": "Pa lisiku lyamsano mpelece ŵanace ŵa ng'ombe msano ni mcece, ngondolo siŵili sya mikambako, ni ŵanace ŵangondolo ŵa mikambako ŵakwana caka cimo 14, wosopewo aŵe ŵangali maŵasi. ",
